From 7e2e6bb39ecf9446bac0eb25ec50c7873474b2e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hasan <gungorbzk@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:32:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] usb: ask "Use USB for" when plugged into a computer

The USB notification lives on a minimum-importance channel, so plugging the
phone into a computer showed nothing you would notice, and in charging-only
mode often nothing at all. Ask once per connection with a heads-up
notification on a new high-importance channel: File transfer (switches to
MTP) or Charging only (dismisses). Tapping it opens the USB settings.

Only when the link gets configured, which a wall charger never does, and only
while USB is charging only; it goes away when the cable is pulled or a mode is
picked some other way.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
